(
    title: "Star Ship",
    developer: Some("Bob Whitehead"),
    description: Some("Your television becomes the window of a Star Ship cockpit, steering deep into space as meteors whip past. Zap enemy space objects — star fighters, flying saucers, space robots — with laser beams, but only while they sit in the target area at the window\'s centre; asteroids cannot be destroyed, and anything that hits you costs a point. The cartridge also carries Warp Drive and Lunar Lander variations."),
